===Etymology===
From the first syllables of [[Belgium|'''Be'''lgium]], [[Netherlands|'''Ne'''therlands]] and [[Luxembourg|'''Lux'''embourg]].

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|blend}} An [[economic]] and [[customs]] [[union]] made up of Belgium, the Netherlands and Luxembourg; one of the [[precursor]]s of the [[European Union]]; the countries which constitute(d) this union.

